<title>GERMANY: Buba says August adjusted jobless rate 10.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Buba says August adjusted jobless rate 10.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank reported the following seasonally adjusted unemployment rates (pct)</p>
<p>PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT	Aug 96     Jul 96     Aug 95</p>
<p> Rate				 10.3    10.3 (10.2)    9.4</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				  9.1	  9.0     8.3 (8.4)</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Rate				 15.2   15.3 (15.4) 13.9 (13.8)</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Labour Office earlier reported the bulk of the jobless figures. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>--Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
